      "card_ids": ["C60", "C62"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "L3 C48 shows oral disopyramide capsule dosing yields mean peak total plasma concentrations of 2.72-2.88 mg/L, confirming meaningful oral exposure for the closest analog; this is consistent with, but not itself proof of, F >= 20%.",
