    },
    {
      "claim": "The remaining L4 records (fexofenadine solubility in surfactant vehicles, nicotine FA) are not transferable to the query and provide no affirmative evidence for F < 20%; full ionization at pH 7.4 is a possible liability but is shared with high-F basic amine comparators.",
